    "lineCount": 24,
    "rawText": "Just as the sky is home to all kinds of Hello, weather,we have theunique human capacity to experience a full range of emotions, thoughts, stories, and situations. World. The way we navigate these impacts every aspect of ourselves and our organizations: culture,ngagement,wellbeing, leadership,and so much more. Just as the healing balm of a sunny day unfolds afterarainstorm-shadow coexisting with light -the most sustainablealthy,resilintl organizations are those that grow alongside inevitableuncertainty,risks,and challenge. There is no innovation without potential failure; no collaboration without conflict. There is no capacity to thrive without the skills to navigate what is. It's a world where the only certainty is uncertainty. Meet EMOTIONAL AGILITY INTRODUCTION",
