    "file": "PG_Page_012_Hooked_Intro_IMG_5579.JPG",
    "moduleId": "03_Hooked",
    "moduleName": "Hooked (被情緒鉤住)",
    "moduleIcon": "🪝",
    "pageType": "Workbook",
    "pageLabel": "Page 12",
    "photoUrl": "/practitioner_guide/photos/PG_Page_012_Hooked_Intro_IMG_5579.JPG",
    "lineCount": 22,
    "rawText": "A Hollywood script lives or dies by its“hook\":the simple premise that captures the audience's interest,sets the story in motion,and drives the action forward. Wemaynot takemeetingswithmovie stars,buteachof us,inurwnwayacrnwritrveryminutfy day,we'rewriting the scripts that get screened at the cinema inside our heads. But in our own stories,getting hooked isn't an edge-of- your-seat thrill. lt's self-defeating reactivity: \"There's no point in trying\" \"That's the way we've always done it\" \"No one ever listens anyway” Teamsandculturese ittooilos,rigidrules,nd unexamined norms. Those well-worn “they're just resistant” lines that can crowd out adaptability. The film keeps running. The viewnarrows. The plot feels.. uninspired. You've seen this film before. What we think or feel starts to stand in for what is. How we act stands in for what is needed. And the scene plays again...and again. This is the cinema inside our heads. This ishooked.",
    "htmlContent": "<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">A Hollywood script lives or dies by its“hook&quot;:the simple</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">premise that captures the audience's interest,sets the</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">story in motion,and drives the action forward.</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">Wemaynot takemeetingswithmovie stars,buteachof</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">us,inurwnwayacrnwritrveryminutfy</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">day,we'rewriting the scripts that get screened at</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">the cinema inside our heads.</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">But in our own stories,getting hooked isn't an edge-of-</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">your-seat thrill. lt's self-defeating reactivity:</p>\n<blockquote class=\"spoken-quote\">&quot;There's no point in trying&quot;</blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"spoken-quote\">&quot;That's the way we've always done it&quot;</blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"spoken-quote\">&quot;No one ever listens anyway”</blockquote>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">Teamsandculturese ittooilos,rigidrules,nd</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">unexamined norms. Those well-worn “they're just</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">resistant” lines that can crowd out adaptability.</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">The film keeps running. The viewnarrows. The plot feels..</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">uninspired. You've seen this film before.</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">What we think or feel starts to stand in for what is.</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">How we act stands in for what is needed.</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">And the scene plays again...and again.</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">This is the cinema inside our heads.</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">This ishooked.</p>"
