    "rawText": "Write to See Continued Read-back What do you notice? ·Did any sentence surpriseyou? Where did understanding begin to emerge? Didyouname difficult emotionshonestlyordidyoufindyourself skippingor explaining them away? Whatfeelsdifferentnow than before you wrote? The writers who benefited most in Pennebaker's research weren't those who pushed emotions aside orvented,but those who began to developinsight.Look for signs of that in your own writing.You don't have to force it. Just notice. Show Up InsightWords I'm learning that... Inotice...I understand... see now...I recognize.lt occurs to me... Step Out Walk YourWhy Move On 60 @2026SUSANDAVID·EMOTIONALAGILITY@·VERSION2.0",
