    "lineCount": 14,
    "rawText": "We·Us The same language practiceworksfor two people,a team,or a whole organization facing a real,consequential situation.Take something significant on the horizon:a reorganization,a major project, a relationship thatis shifting, a move,a culture you're trying to change,a community in transition.Imagine that a year from now it has failed.Then write the story of how that happened: what wentwrong first,whatwent unsaid,and what becameclear too late.Each person writes privately first,then shares. Then,together: Whoseread differed,and what did that lone voice catch?(Ifno one differed, that's worth noticing too.) Which risk showed upmost across the stories,and what's the one thingyoull o to make it less likely to happen? STEPPINGOUT 61",
    "htmlContent": "<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">We·Us</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">The same language practiceworksfor two people,a team,or a whole</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">organization facing a real,consequential situation.Take something significant</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">on the horizon:a reorganization,a major project, a relationship thatis shifting,</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">a move,a culture you're trying to change,a community in transition.Imagine</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">that a year from now it has failed.Then write the story of how that happened:</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">what wentwrong first,whatwent unsaid,and what becameclear too late.Each</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">person writes privately first,then shares.</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">Then,together:</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">Whoseread differed,and what did that lone voice catch?(Ifno one differed,</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">that's worth noticing too.)</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">Which risk showed upmost across the stories,and what's the one thingyoull o</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">to make it less likely to happen?</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">STEPPINGOUT 61</p>"
