    "rawText": "DISCOMfORT Invitation→Prompt The Teeter-TotterPrinciple invites you tofind thebalancepoint between The Teeter- these two extremes — the spot where your competence and comfort meet the Totter Principle excitement (and even healthy stress) of the unknown.We have a word for too little(underwhelmed) and a word for too much(overwhelmed),and almost never use the onebetween them:whelmed. This is the zone where learning becomes alive again,where you operate at the edgeofyourability:otbored,notoverwhelmedbutngagedinacreativ tension that stretches you just enough to grow.It is intentional,a placeyou choose andkeep choosing. MOVINGON 109",
