    "htmlContent": "<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">PocketPractice</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">Take This Job In 2minutesor less</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">and TweakIt Mostroles are notredesigned from above;they arereshaped from within,one small tweak at a time.Researcherscall it jobcrafting.</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">Use when:A task on repeat drains more than it gives,in a roleyou're</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">keeping,fornow.The taskcan beoneof yours,oroneyou sharewih</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">others.</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">How:Pick one taskyou'll do anyway this week,and make one tweak:</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">Tweak the how —fold in a strength: your way of explaining,</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">organizing,or connecting.</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">Tweak thewho—do one partof itwith,or for,someone.Shared load</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">is lighter; witnessed workmeans more.</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">Tweak the whyname the value the task quietly serves.</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">DebriefAweek in,ask:which tweak held,andwhat did it change?</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">Small crafting,repeated,inds thewant-toinside the havetond</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">moments become movements.</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">Show Up</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">Step Out</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">Walk Your Why</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">Move On</p>\n<p class=\"guide-paragraph\">112 @2026 SUSANDAVID·EMOTIONALAGILITY@VERSION2.0</p>"
